{"event_id": "evt_0028", "session": 1, "turn_no": 2, "world_time": "Sandbox c, night", "actor": "gm", "kind": "gm_narration", "summary": "Narration for amw8k3f0d1vngmm.", "visibility": "player", "knowledge_type": "fact", "known_to": [], "caused_by": [], "roll_ids": [], "tags": [], "details": {"text": "The blade goes dark with a sigh and you clip the hilt to your hip. Both hands free, you reach back and work at the knots over your shoulder. It takes a minute: the rope has bitten in under the bottle's weight. Then the steel comes loose into your arms, cold and heavy, and you set it upright beside the shed door.\n\nThe harness rides lighter but no quieter. Thirty feet to the middle silo, slower than you'd walk unburdened, the torch and the last bottle knocking against your back at every step.\n\nYou stand at Silo Three's door, the weld seam in front of you. What do you do?\n"}, "idempotency_key": "amw8k3f0d1vngmm:narr"}
